<Section id="about" index={3} title="About">
    <div class="space-y-5 text-[15px] sm:text-base text-ink leading-relaxed">
        <p>
            I've spent over twenty years building enterprise-grade software,
            and the tooling and infrastructure underneath it. That second
            layer decides whether engineers spend their day building or
            fighting their setup.
        </p>
        <p>
            Most recently, Salesforce. Before it, two stints at MarkLogic
            ending as Director of Cloud Services, and earlier work at
            BloomReach, Booz Allen Hamilton, and Boeing.
        </p>
        <p>
            I'm based just outside Denver and work with teams wherever they
            are.
        </p>
    </div>
</Section>
